---
import { LINKS } from '../lib/links';
---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
    <h2
      class="font-display text-3xl leading-[1.12] font-bold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-[2.6rem]"
    >
      Veinte minutos, tu operación, sin diapositivas.
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
      Te enseñamos el registro en vivo desde WhatsApp y te decimos qué tan expuesto está tu
      control actual.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3.5">
      <a
        href={LINKS.demo}
        class="rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-brand-600/25 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-brand-700 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-600/25"
      >
        Agendar demo
      </a>
      <a
        href={LINKS.whatsapp}
        class="rounded-full border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-ink-900 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-neutral-400"
      >
        Escribirnos por WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
